{
  "title": "在工作流活动中使用团队",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>在工作流活动中使用团队/角色（仅限管理员）</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">系统支持将团队身份组/角色指定为工作流映射活动的分配对象。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>这允许基于负责待完成工作的用户组（团队）进行动态工作流分配。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>当从工作流映射实例化工作流进程时，团队身份组或角色分配将被转换为团队或角色中每个成员的个人分配。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>例如，如果在某个特定条目的工作流映射活动中指定了团队身份组作为分配对象，则从该工作流映射创建的工作流进程将为团队的每个成员生成个人分配。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>根据工作流映射中定义的分配属性，将适用不同的规则（参见下方示例）。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>类似地，如果在某个特定条目的工作流映射活动中指定了团队角色（如团队经理）作为分配对象，则从该工作流映射创建的工作流进程将为团队中拥有该角色的每个成员生成个人分配（参见下方示例）。</span></p>\n  <h2><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">工作流示例：</span></b></h2>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">以下示例展示了当在工作流映射活动模板上指定团队身份组时，系统如何处理该情况。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>当创建相应的工作流进程时，系统会为团队的成员创建个人分配。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">以下示例使用以下团队，该团队有两名成员（用户 1、用户 2）：</span></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"Image\" src=\"/aras-images/image513.gif\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_6\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">ECN-10001 的工作流映射活动中以团队为唯一分配对象。投票权重= 100，必需=0，所有成员=0。该活动在工作流进程中的最终分配结果如下：</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; left: 0px; top: 493px;\" width=\"394\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 12.775%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 38.265%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 35.459%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">被分配人</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">投票权重</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">必需</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 1</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">100</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">0</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 2</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">100</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">0</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_body\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">ECN-10002 的工作流映射活动中以团队为唯一分配对象。投票权重= 50，必需=0，所有成员=1。该活动在工作流进程中的最终分配结果如下：</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; left: 0px; top: 493px;\" width=\"394\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 12.775%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 38.265%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 35.459%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">被分配人</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">投票权重</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">必需</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 1</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">50</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">0</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 2</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">50</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">0</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_Body\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">ECN-10003 的工作流映射活动中以团队为唯一分配对象。投票权重= 100，必需=1，所有成员=0。该活动在工作流进程中的最终分配结果如下：</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; left: 0px; top: 493px;\" width=\"394\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 12.775%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 38.265%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 35.459%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">被分配人</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">投票权重</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">必需</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 1</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">100</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">1</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 2</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">100</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">1</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">ECN-10004 的工作流映射活动中以团队为唯一分配对象。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">投票权重= 100，必需=1，所有成员=1。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">该活动在工作流进程中的最终分配结果如下：</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; left: 0px; top: 493px;\" width=\"394\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 12.775%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 38.265%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 35.459%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">被分配人</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">投票权重</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\">必需</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 1</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">50</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">1</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用户 2</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">50</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">1</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Note\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Note\">必须为工作流所适用的每个条目实例的 <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">team_id</span> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">属性设置团队条目。</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">这为系统在工作流进程的活动分配中提供了必要的团队信息。</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <p class=\"Procedure_Title\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">操作步骤：</span></u></b></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" start=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <ol class=\"Decimal\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">在现有工作流映射中查看某个活动（编辑模式），点击 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">分配</i></b> 关系工具栏上的 <b><i>添加新关系</i></b> 按钮。系统将打开一个搜索对话框，其中列出了系统中现有的身份组。</span></li>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 4.5pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">使用蓝色搜索栏，筛选 <span class=\"GramE\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Is</i></b></span> <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Alias=0</i></b> 且 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Classification=Team</i></b> 的身份组。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>这将返回可用的系统团队角色身份组，可直接用于活动分配。</span></li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img height=\"376\" src=\"/aras-images/accessid2.jpg\" width=\"838\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"3\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 4.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">从搜索对话框中选择一个或多个身份组，然后点击 <img src=\"/aras-images/OK.jpg\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">。</span> <span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">系统将把所选的团队身份组（角色）填充到关系网格中。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>这些特殊的团队身份组可以与其他身份组组合使用来定义工作流活动的分配。</span></li>\n  </ol>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"4\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 4.5pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">在 <strong>活动</strong> 选项卡上设置其余活动。</span>\n      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><img height=\"641\" src=\"/aras-images/ecnworkflow.jpg\" width=\"746\"></p>\n  <ol class=\"Decimal\" start=\"5\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">点击 <strong>进程变量</strong> 选项卡，添加相应的工作流映射变量。</li>\n  </ol>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "using_teams_in_workflow_activities.htm"
}